  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Business need",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all central government departments, their executive agencies and non-departmental public bodies (collectively referred to as 'in-scope organisations').",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The Carbon Reduction Schedule published alongside this PPN contains standard terms and conditions to support contract specific decarbonisation objectives. The Carbon Reduction Schedule also provides a framework to monitor and assess the supplier’s decarbonisation performance. These include contract specific greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions reporting, setting supplier GHG emissions reduction targets and monitoring and reducing GHG emissions throughout the life of the contract though a supplier GHG emissions Reduction Plan.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Use of the Carbon Reduction Plan is optional and should be included where relevant to the subject-matter of the contract and proportionate to do so; it may not be appropriate to include the Carbon Reduction Schedule in all contracts.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN supplements the existing obligations of PPN 06/21 (taking account of Carbon Reduction Plans in the procurement of major government contracts).",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In determining the appropriateness of including the Carbon Reduction Schedule, in-scope organisations should assess their understanding (i.e. maturity) of carbon reduction initiatives and how to apply and monitor these.",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should:",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "assess their understanding (i.e. maturity) of carbon reduction initiatives and how to apply and monitor these when determining the appropriateness of including the Carbon Reduction Schedule",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "assess the value and estimated carbon GHG emissions linked to the contract",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "assess the criticality of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 62: Quality assurance standards and environmental management standards",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Carbon reduction contract schedule",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
